# No test runner: the lock made from this file is what the image installs.
# pytest and pytest-asyncio were named here, so the image shipped them with
# everything they bring; so was httpx, which no module of the service
# imports: it is what fastapi.testclient.TestClient needs, in the unit tests
# (#788). The unit-test job installs pytest, its plugins and httpx on top of
# this lock (.github/workflows/test.yml), at the versions
# tests/ci-tools/requirements.in gives. To run the tests by hand, see the
# README.
